&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work/life balance that supports our employees’ varying needs:&lt;/strong&gt; We value the well-being of our employees, recognizing that a healthy work-life balance is pivotal to our collective success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
